{
    "title": "Board World - All in one game",
    "description": "\ud83e\udde9 Are you looking for classic board games for 2 players or a group of friends? Or do you simply need a dice game to decide whether to win or lose quickly? Don't worry, <b>Board World</b> will answer these questions for you!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 <b>Board World</b> - all table board games in one game, is a brand-new and super entertaining board game collection. This is an engaging, well-designed game that promises to bring laughter and happiness to players.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <b>BOARD WORLD GAME COLLECTION</b> \ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfae\r\n\ud83d\udc0a Alligator Doctor: a thrilling tooth examination crocodile game.\r\n\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f Pirate Saber: a breathtaking but so fun pirate stabbing game.\r\n\u2716\ufe0f\u2b55 Tic Tac Toe: a typical XO game for all ages.\r\n\ud83d\udfe1 4 Link: a classic connect game.\r\n\ud83d\udd34 Drop It: a simple but exciting drop-ball game.\r\n\u265f\ufe0f Chess Game: an upgraded game for chess champions.\r\n\ud83c\udc04 Mahjong: an amusing classic mahjong game.\r\n\ud83c\udfb4 Card Match: a highly addicting matching game.\r\n\ud83c\udfd1 Puck Swipe: a fun swiping game for sports lovers.\r\n\ud83c\udfd2 Air Hockey: a realistic sports game for all ice hockey fans.\r\n\ud83d\udc34 Racing Horses: a strategic board game with horses.\r\n\ud83d\udc27 Penguin Match: a fascinating memory game with cute penguins.\r\n... and more games are waiting for you to explore!\r\n\r\n<b>KEY FEATURES:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 100% Free and Offline.\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 Suitable for all ages.\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 Small file size, yet high-quality game.\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 User-friendly interface and stylish design.\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 Basic tutorial, understandable illustration.\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 Available in multiple languages.\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 The more players, the merrier!\r\n\ud83c\udfb2 30+ relaxing board games, more games are coming soon!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 These parlour board games are suitable for a large group of people. With <b>Board World</b>, you can easily create fun parties and night gatherings that make unforgettable memories with friends and family. Or when you're alone, you can enjoy playing with smart AI bots.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 <b>Board World</b> is created as a relaxing experience for you after a tiring day at work or school whose pressure will gradually disappear like the domino effect. It's a splendid game for killing time and relieving stress.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 If you are a fan of fun board games, you won't want to miss this app! Download now to discover <b>Board World</b>!",
